n&#176; 69.470, de 10 de abril de 2025, que aprovou a Estrutura Organizacional e o Quadro Demonstrativo dos Cargos em Comiss&atilde;o e das Fun&ccedil;&otilde;es de Confian&ccedil;a da Secretaria dos Direitos da Pessoa com Defici&ecirc;ncia.</h3>\n<p>O VICE-GOVERNADOR, EM EXERC&Iacute;CIO NO CARGO DE GOVERNADOR DO ESTADO DE S&Atilde;O PAULO, no uso de suas atribui&ccedil;&otilde;es legais,</p><p>Decreta:</p><p><strong>Artigo 1&#176; -</strong> Fica alterado o Anexo V-A do <a data-idAnotacao='210848' class='anotacao-link' target='blank' href='https://www.al.sp.gov.br/norma/210848'>Decreto n&#176; 69.470, de 10 de abril de 2025</a>, passando a vigorar na conformidade do Anexo que integra este decreto.</p><p><strong>Artigo 2&#176; -</strong> Este decreto entra em vigor na data de sua publica&ccedil;&atilde;o.</p><p>FEL&Iacute;CIO RAMUTH</p><p>Arthur Luis Pinho de Lima</p><p>Marcos da Costa</p><h4>ANEXO</h4><h4>ANEXO V-A<br>Quadro Resumo dos Cargos e Fun&ccedil;&otilde;es Extintos</h4><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:837.281px;\"><table style=\"background-color:transparent !important;border-bottom:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-top:1px solid black;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:transparent !important;border-bottom:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-top:1px solid black;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;\">Cargo em Comiss&atilde;o</td><td style=\"background-color:transparent !important;border-bottom:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-top:1px solid black;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;\">Quantidade</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:transparent !important;border-bottom:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-top:1px solid black;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;\">Secret&aacute;rio Executivo</td><td style=\"background-color:transparent !important;border-bottom:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-top:1px solid black;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;\">1</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:transparent !important;border-bottom:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-top:1px solid black;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;\">Chefe de Gabinete</td><td style=\"background-color:transparent !important;border-bottom:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-top:1px solid black;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;\">1</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:transparent !important;border-bottom:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-top:1px solid black;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;\">Assessor de Gabinete I</td><td style=\"background-color:transparent !important;border-bottom:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-top:1px solid black;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;\">1</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:transparent !important;border-bottom:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-top:1px solid black;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;\">Assessor de Gabinete II</td><td style=\"background-color:transparent !important;border-bottom:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-top:1px solid black;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;\">1</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:transparent !important;border-bottom:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-top:1px solid black;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;\">Assessor I</td><td style=\"background-color:transparent !important;border-bottom:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-top:1px solid black;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;\">4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:transparent !important;border-bottom:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black;border-r